# Keep the container build context to source + manifests only. Without this, the build context
# includes `target/` (tens of GB of host build artifacts across every crate/profile ever built
# here) and the gitignored `research/` corpus (vendored upstream Vala/C sources, papers, specs --
# real and useful for development, irrelevant to compiling `ntkd`), which is slow at best and can
# exhaust build-storage disk space at worst.
target/
research/
.git/
.github/
contrib/
*.md
